@salesReadUrl = http://localhost:5162
@privateGatewayUrl = http://localhost:5001
@restaurantId = 5c7811d9-b92c-4453-8f8a-4bdb9f089d31
@saleId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Salud directa de Sales Read
GET {{salesReadUrl}}/health

### Últimas ventas, todos los locales
GET {{salesReadUrl}}/api/sales
Accept: application/json

### Ventas de un local
GET {{salesReadUrl}}/api/sales?restaurantId={{restaurantId}}
Accept: application/json

### Una venta por su identificador
GET {{salesReadUrl}}/api/sales/{{saleId}}
Accept: application/json

### La misma consulta a través del gateway privado
GET {{privateGatewayUrl}}/api/sales?restaurantId={{restaurantId}}
Accept: application/json
